Package: sstFun
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-10-28
Title: Estimating Stop Signal Reaction Times and Stop Signal Delay
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Samuel", family = "Sonntag", email="samuel@samuel-sonntag.de", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person(given = "Carolin", family = "Dudschig", email="carolin.dudschig@uni-tuebingen.de", role = c("aut")),
    person(given = "Ian G", family = "Mackenzie", email="ian.mackenzie@uni-tuebingen.de", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Helper functions for estimating the SSRT in a Stop-Signal Task 
  based on Verbruggen et al. (2019) <doi:https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.46323>
  and a mid-run estimates method for computing the mean SSD based on Levitt
  (1970) <https://doi.org/10.1121/1.1912375>.
